            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "In this study, we investigate the advantages and limitations of a neural-network emulator of the sub-shelf regions not resolved in the 1\u00ba version of the NEMO ocean-sea-ice model (Nucleus for European Modelling of the Ocean, Madec and the NEMO System Team (2024)), which we train using NEMO simulations with a resolution of 0.25\u00b0 (4-14 km around Antarctica).",
