            "source_entity_instance": "NEMO ocean-sea-ice model",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "HAS_PHYSICAL_FEATURE",
            "target_entity_instance": "eANT025 grid",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "This work aims to produce a neural-network emulator of the sub-ice-shelf regions not resolved in the 1\u00ba version of the NEMO ocean-sea-ice model (Nucleus for European Modelling of the Ocean, Madec and the NEMO System Team, 2024). In order to do this, we employ a selection of NEMO simulations of ocean conditions run on the eORCA025 or eANT025 grids, which are global (Mathiot and Jourdain, 2023) and regional circum-Antarctic (Oliv\u00e9 Abell\u00f3 et al., 2025) grids with a resolution of 0.25\u00b0 (4-14 km around Antarctica).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
